WEBVTT

00:07:28.903 --> 00:07:31.489
they've been stripped
from everything they had,

00:07:31.489 --> 00:07:32.656
even their identities.

00:07:32.698 --> 00:07:34.950
Welcome them in [your] homes,
take their hands,

00:07:34.992 --> 00:07:37.620
help them to settle,
make them feel at home.

00:07:38.412 --> 00:07:39.914
Also, get involved if you want.

00:07:39.955 --> 00:07:42.082
There are organizations
that are doing stuff,

00:07:42.082 --> 00:07:44.502
especially for girls education
back in Afghanistan.

00:07:44.502 --> 00:07:47.463
Get involved, donate money,
volunteer your time,

00:07:47.505 --> 00:07:49.632
either with people who are arriving here

00:07:49.673 --> 00:07:51.592
or back in Afghanistan.

00:07:51.592 --> 00:07:53.052
SA: Thanks, Kiana.

00:07:53.052 --> 00:07:54.220
KH: Thank you.

00:07:54.261 --> 00:07:56.096
(Applause)